OL,3,GNEWSAThere's finally a treatment for my
OL,4,Afive-year-old's dementia - but it'll
OL,5,Acost me #3m
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mum of a five-year-old boy with a
OL,8,Frare form of dementia has to pay almost
OL,9,F#3m for his life saving treatment.
OL,11,FTate McDaid, from Swansea, was
OL,12,Fdiagnosed with Sanfilippo Syndrome - a
OL,13,Fform of dementia that just over 100 UK
OL,14,Fchildren have - when he was four.
OL,16,FIn September, the first gene therapy to
OL,17,Ftreat the condition in children was
OL,18,Fapproved in the US.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
