OL,3,GNEWSAThere's finally a treatment for my
OL,4,Afive-year-old's dementia - but it'll
OL,5,Acost me #3m
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis mum Tammy said she spent "months
OL,8,Fpraying" for its approval but
OL,9,Fdiscovered the treatment is to set cost
OL,10,F#2.95 million per child, with it
OL,11,Funclear how families outside the US can
OL,12,Ffund this.
